{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1479609-scion-type-examples","id":1479609,"title":"Scion Type Examples?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-27T16:09:03-07:00","id":1479609,"title":"Scion Type Examples?","content":"Heya! I am making a scion campaign for some friends of mine, and on the discord server have a channel compiling a list of characters from fiction and mythology that correlate as examples of the different types of scion. For example, Bell from &quot;Is it Wrong to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon&quot; would be a chosen of zeus. Does anyone know of any examples? I will compile a list below of what I have so far:<br /> <br /> Born - Perseus Jackson (Poseidon), Marvel's Thor (Odin), Heracles/Hercules (Zeus), Siegmund and Sieglinde (Odin), Wonder Woman (Zeus/Hades depending on version), Magnus Chase (Freyr), Shadow Moon (Odin), Kratos (Zeus)<br /> Chosen - Bell (Zeus), Carter Kane (Horus), Sadie Kane (Isis), Marvel's Loki (Frigg), Marc Spector / Steven Grant / ? / Moon Knight / Mr. Knight (Khonshu), Odysseus (Athena), Diomedes (Athena)<br /> Created - Adam, Eve, Asushunamir (Enki and/or Ishtar), Galatea (Aphrodite), 1941-2011 Wonder Woman (Various)<br /> Incarnate - Historical Pharaohs (Various), Jesus, The Dashavataras (Vishnu), Cu Chulainn (Lugh), Pryderi (Maponos), Tia Dalma (Calypso)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12517,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12517-storyteller323","user":"Storyteller323","date":". 05-02-2022, 03:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12517-storyteller323","name":"Storyteller323","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-27T16:15:06-07:00","i